# Workflow preferences index (plugin-owned — regenerated on update)

Trigger → file map for `.claude/preferences/`. Skills read THIS file (not the preference bodies) at plan / implement / scaffold time; a body is read only when its trigger matches.

Rows are generated from the workflow's preference library and **rewritten on every `/workflow-update`** — don't hand-edit. Project-specific triggers go in `.claude/project-notes/INDEX.md`.

